=== BATCH SCREENING TASK ===
Review: Adjuvant progestagens for endometrial cancer
Total studies to screen: 10

SELECTION CRITERIA:
Randomised controlled trials (RCTs) of progestagen therapy in women who have had surgery for endometrial cancer.

INSTRUCTIONS: For each study below, decide INCLUDE or EXCLUDE.
